# Ignore all
*

# Unignore all with extensions
!*.*

# Unignore all dirs
!*/

!LICENSE

### Above combination will ignore all files without extension ###
.venv
# Ignore files with extension `.class` & `.exe`
*.class
*.exe
data
test.*
.vscode*
*.csv
.*
# Ignore `bin` dir
bin/
# or
*/bin/*

# Unignore all `.exe` in `bin` dir
!*/bin/*.exe